# Frontend Conventions

- Encapsulate UI in ViewComponents (class + ERB); no large inline markup in controller views
- Tailwind utilities only — no custom CSS frameworks or `<style>` blocks
- Stimulus only under `app/javascript/controllers/` — no other JS frameworks
- All surfaces responsive (mobile → desktop)
- Payment widgets: `payments_<vendor>_<flow>_controller.js`
- Captcha widgets: `captcha_<vendor>_controller.js`
- Ignore page templates under `app/services/page_layout_templates/templates/` unless explicitly asked
